{"name": "Mortal Shell II", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/d2134969ba7cc8c4f492b2f8aaab56ac.poster.avif?t=1787666100\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/d2134969ba7cc8c4f492b2f8aaab56ac.webm?t=1787666100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/d2134969ba7cc8c4f492b2f8aaab56ac.mp4?t=1787666100\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras_big/aa44b4940f5ec0464a73af531e88ad67.webp?t=1787666100\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/aa44b4940f5ec0464a73af531e88ad67.avif?t=1787666100\" width=\"1560\"/></span>Mortal Shell II is a standalone sequel to Mortal Shell that significantly expands on the original with unrestricted, adrenaline-charged combat, extensive weapon upgrades, and free exploration. <br/> <br/>The forgotten Shells of eight lost warriors are scattered throughout Mortal Shell II\u2019s ravaged world. Seek and possess these Shells, unleash their innate abilities, and discover the story of each by unravelling their secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"347\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/c0e3ced798be9dbbf7d2a95e54f81966.avif?t=1787666100\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras_big/791165393e08671874255ecbf69aff22.webp?t=1787666100\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/791165393e08671874255ecbf69aff22.avif?t=1787666100\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Mortal Shell II offers a clean, agile and grounded combat system, with options to think strategically about upgrading melee and ranged weapons.<br/><br/>Unrestricted by stamina, players exploit multiple tactics to shatter enemy posture and strike critically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/538950c9cd1e0834cf763f8697960ff7.poster.avif?t=1787666100\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/538950c9cd1e0834cf763f8697960ff7.webm?t=1787666100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/538950c9cd1e0834cf763f8697960ff7.mp4?t=1787666100\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras_big/808cfe22fa37f5597587164f84c705b4.webp?t=1787666100\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/808cfe22fa37f5597587164f84c705b4.avif?t=1787666100\" width=\"1560\"/></span>Mortal Shell II\u2019s open world is compact, tightly interconnected and immersive. It is designed with respect for the player's time. <br/> <br/>Those who wander from the golden path can discover new Shells, weaponry, upgrades, curiosities and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Their Flesh Is Your Weapon. Mortal Shell II is a standalone sequel action-RPG with adrenaline-charged, high-stakes combat. Possess warrior Shells, dethrone false gods, redeem a ravaged world.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/0a4c23b70ced29fac344186ea564dae67c80cfd6/header.jpg?t=1787666100", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Souls-like", "Dark Fantasy", "Violent", "Action RPG", "Singleplayer", "Difficult"], "developers": "Cold Symmetry", "publishers": "Cold Symmetry", "release_date": "Aug 20, 2026", "price": "$49.99", "appid": "2584270", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "5 June 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/bUBG57rc3Us", "first_seen": 1780610400.0, "review_rank": 465}